Package: OncoBiomarkerR
Title: TCGA-LUAD Transcriptomic Biomarker Pipeline
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ranak", "Halder", email = "your.email@domain.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A reproducible Bioconductor workflow for TCGA-LUAD RNA-seq
    ingestion, differential expression by tumor stage, genomic annotation, and
    heatmap visualization. The exploratory DESeq2 model does not include batch
    correction and requires independent validation.
